- PostgreSQL: `src/scribe_mcp/storage/postgres/__init__.py`, `src/scribe_mcp/db/init.sql`, `src/scribe_mcp/db/postgres_migrations/005_apply_preview_receipts.sql`
- Remote: `src/scribe_mcp/storage/remote.py`, `src/scribe_mcp/server_sse.py`
